    "title": "Bozeman ranked No. 1 college town again as MSU enrollment grows - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Rattner NonStop Local Digital Journalist ,\n6 hours ago BOZEMAN, Mont. —Bozeman is ranked as America’s No. 1 college town for the third straight year in RentCafe.com's latest list. Bozeman was placed at the top ahead of Pullman, Washington; Clemson, South Carolina; Laramie, Wyoming; and Gainesville, Florida. Western cities held much of the top 10. The ranking... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
